{"id":"n14115-1-7","stage":1,"title":"영화배우 · 电影演员","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14115-1-7-1","ko":"나 어제 영화 보러 갔다가 영화배우도 봤어.","zh":"我昨天去看了电影，还见到电影演员了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}},{"text":"보러","meaning":"见，碰头","explanation":"보다：见，碰头；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보러","audio":"/audio/d5e8ae6946132d84eb67.mp3"}},{"text":"갔다가","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔다가","audio":"/audio/87ea69e93c0d478e4c4d.mp3"}},{"text":"영화배우도","meaning":"电影演员","explanation":"영화배우：电影演员；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"영화배우","audio":"/audio/2c41a7fe17a31131b5a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14115","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화배우도","audio":"/audio/da2fb2685ee78fda66c1.mp3"}},{"text":"봤어.","meaning":"见，碰头","explanation":"보다：见，碰头；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤어","audio":"/audio/0d4b5b0b4b8a9c03faf0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"见，碰头","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"以某种目的而见人。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"2c41a7fe17a31131","term":"영화배우","zh":"电影演员","audio":"/audio/2c41a7fe17a31131b5a1.mp3","entryId":"14115","definition":"出演电影的人。","pronunciation":["영화배우"]}],"audio":"/audio/9a26a50ff5b48ea2f79e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14115-1-7-2","ko":"정말? 누굴 봤는데?","zh":"真的吗？你见到谁了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"누굴","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audi